leaning and laundry in the mansion and tends to the courtyard. Her heavy workload often requires other maids to pitch in. Her maid uniform sets her apart; it's a unique design ingeniously repurposed from her kimono."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though reserved and soft-spoken, Lavender harbors an insatiable curiosity, particularly regarding Akira, a newcomer from beyond the mansion's walls. She cares deeply for the courtyard plants, treating them like her own children."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akira's Memo"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lavender handles all the cleaning and laundry in the mansion, including the undies, which was a bit awkward for me. I tried to do my own laundry, but she wouldn't hear of it—\"strictly business,\" she says. It's still embarrassing that other maids might get their hands on them, though. Lavender usually keeps a poker face, but every now and then she lets her guard down, revealing a sweet smile, especially when she's humming away in the courtyard."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136405"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"館で清掃、洗濯を一手に担う洗濯メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中庭の管理もしており、作業量が多いので彼女の周りでは他のメイド達の姿を見かける事も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他のメイドとは意匠の違うデザインのメイド服を着ている。 彼女が私物で持っていた着物をアレンジして今も使い続けているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気で物静かだが、好奇心が強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"館の外の存在である主人公に興味を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中庭の植物たちを大切にしており、我が子のようにかわいがっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26334","sourceWorkId":"36203","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お客様の目を楽しませる事が出来るなら、それが喜びです。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"この子たちもこうして綺麗に育ってくれて嬉しいです」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"館で清掃、洗濯を一手に担う洗濯メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中庭の管理もしており、作業量が多いので彼女の周りでは他のメイド達の姿を見かける事も多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他のメイドとは意匠の違うデザインのメイド服を着ている。 彼女が私物で持っていた着物をアレンジして今も使い続けているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内気で物静かだが、好奇心が強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"館の外の存在である主人公に興味を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中庭の植物たちを大切にしており、我が子のようにかわいがっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154290"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"74 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26334","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26334","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26334","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"74 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26334","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"48 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26334","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4c/4cd4a94a020516310b24048f9473c2eeae20327a85afe7005240b79109dbb63b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d43a413f77ae9704c38b23dbb111ccea74328919c5a42814cc4cc733ef6593f9.webp","width":120,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"霧島はるな","creatorId":"vndb:s2698","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2698","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2698","name":"霧島はるな(水無月じゅん)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:482850:154290:13771:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c136406","characterName":"ノワール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"154291","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"482850"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26335"],"vndbCharacterId":"c136406"},"originalCharacterName":"ノワール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"64"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"145"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"57"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"43"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"This flower field is a little secret between Onii-chan and us. So please feel free to drop by anytime the fancy takes you.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lily is the black-haired maid at the manor who runs the kitchen. She's the go-to person for all meals and can whip up just about any dish, whether Japanese or Western. But her talents don't stop there—she has a green thumb, overseeing Lavender’s garden."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While she might seem like the youngest and most innocent one, Lily holds a surprise in the age department, and she's not hiding it. She is a real people person, always full of energy. Without batting an eye, she hits it off with Akira, an outsider."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though clueless about TV and modern books, she knows her way around classic literature. And now, she's set her sights on the \"story\" Akira is cooking up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akira's Memo"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"This little maid is always so lively. Rumor has it she's got a few more candles on her birthday cake than you'd expect, but you'd never guess her actual age based on how she acts. Still, her wealth of knowledge doesn't align with her youthful looks. When chatting with her, I sometimes get this vibe that there's more beneath the surface. Out of all the maids, she's probably the biggest mystery."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c136406"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"館で出会う黒髪の料理メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食事を一手に引き受けており、メニューも和洋問わずほとんどの物を作る事が出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"植物についての造詣も深く、ラベンダーの庭園管理は彼女の手解き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は最年少で言動も無邪気だが、実年齢は結構高いとの事。本人も否定していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこくて元気が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外の人間である彰に対しても物おじせずに仲良くなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テレビや現代の小説は全く知らないが古典文学には少々詳しい。主人公が作る『物語』に興味津々。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26335","sourceWorkId":"36203","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この花畑は私たちとお兄ちゃんの秘密の場所。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だからいつでも来ていいよ。好きな時にね」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"館で出会う黒髪の料理メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"食事を一手に引き受けており、メニューも和洋問わずほとんどの物を作る事が出来る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"植物についての造詣も深く、ラベンダーの庭園管理は彼女の手解き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は最年少で言動も無邪気だが、実年齢は結構高いとの事。本人も否定していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人懐っこくて元気が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外の人間である彰に対しても物おじせずに仲良くなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"テレビや現代の小説は全く知らないが古典文学には少々詳しい。主人公が作る『物語』に興味津々。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"154291"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"64 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26335","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26335","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"145 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26335","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26335","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"43 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26335","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/dbc2d7476fd51e88c2a394af0c2ade905c8292d9001a05c26d4e7d5b9f7de270.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.da