"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26340"],"vndbCharacterId":"c137498"},"originalCharacterName":"黒井 修一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"......Welcome. Sensei. Please take any seat you like.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The owner of the 'Kuroneko' café."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuichi has a decent rapport with the mansion's maids, who hook him up with medicine for his mom. His better half works in the city and returns around these parts during a long weekend or holiday."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shuuichi mostly keeps to himself, not one for small talk with customers. His daughter Miyako, though? The polar opposite. That's why folks say they're two sides of the same coin, so to speak."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c137498"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"喫茶店『くろねこ』のマスター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"館のメイド達と親交があり、母親への薬を分けて貰っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妻は都会の方で仕事をしており、連休などにはこちらに戻ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙な性格をしており、客とあまり会話をする事もない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘の宮子は正反対の性格になっており、ある意味よく似た親子と言われる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26340","sourceWorkId":"36203","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……いらっしゃい。先生。お好きな席にどうぞ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喫茶店『くろねこ』のマスター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"館のメイド達と親交があり、母親への薬を分けて貰っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妻は都会の方で仕事をしており、連休などにはこちらに戻ってくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寡黙な性格をしており、客とあまり会話をする事もない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘の宮子は正反対の性格になっており、ある意味よく似た親子と言われる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"156500"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"178 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26340","sourceWorkId":"36203","sourceFi